      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the render-fat in the copper mug over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and potatoes, and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Add the beef broth, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1 1/2 hours, or until the lamb is tender.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh dill and minced garlic.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional fresh dill if desired."
